Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fa-d256 (68a #1, 68c #1, 68d #1): RDNA3 FA D256 prefill
 variants under GGML_HIP_FA_D256_VAR (24v/#31746 barriers, #31746 config
 nbatch_fa 32, exp2f, transposed V tile in LDS, K2/V2 sweep); default off,
 unmeasured

